# Public keys that may sign stamps (docs/guides/stamps.md#signing), allowed-signers format, one line per maintainer:
#
#   <principal> namespaces="coney-stamp"[,valid-before="YYYYMMDDHHMMSSZ"] ssh-ed25519 AAAA... comment
#
# A key is added or retired by pull request only, and a new key merges in its own pull request first (a release check
# reads this file from the base commit). valid-before is in UTC, with the Z. The namespace is the `stamps.namespace` of .github/conventions.yml.
# Private halves live in each maintainer's SSH agent and are never in this repository.
